{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "94382800bf681a795d6bd9cbd6e1a64f462c49b45aeda78e3095d7dd40206c82", "ja": "（真美と律子が出演したアイドルフェスは大成功！\nふたりは大トリという大役を見事に務めてくれた！）", "zh": "（真美和律子参加的偶像祭大获成功！两人出色地完成了压轴演出这一重任！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "126b225e497c3af8e0421269b00953663ba506c24abf8db068215f22a618215a", "ja": "兄ちゃん、ちゃんと見てた？　真美のカツヤク！\nカンペキなステージだったっしょ！？", "zh": "哥哥，你有好好看吧？真美的精彩表现！\n是场完美的演出，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "378a9cf0bacf1fbb3cc9bd0551058c97468f194ef4479bc679fd5162c77cb463", "ja": "ああ、バッチリ見てたよ！\n大トリに相応しい、最高のパフォーマンスだったな！", "zh": "啊，我看得一清二楚！\n真不愧是压轴，表演太精彩了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "9bf79e0d4baa27b8ba54eeee407a141e2c55a070d2fe15f658cc6a5ca3b14018", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　でしょでしょ？\n今日は真美、絶好調だったかんね！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪对吧对吧？\n今天真美状态超好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b5c775cdcadb1b8fcc8514bd6ff993e9eed0b9a978edb3935a142530877f26e0", "ja": "確かに、いつも以上にキレを感じたな。これも昨日、\n律子が緊張をほぐしてくれたおかげかな？", "zh": "确实，感觉比平时更有状态。这也是因为昨天\n律子帮你放松了紧张情绪吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "71cdcddc6b4b171f75622eff6c555e8cace400a9c04f815cf69415894e9ac09e", "ja": "へっ、なんで知ってんの！？\nもしかして兄ちゃん、盗み聞きしてた？", "zh": "欸，你怎么知道的！？\n难道说，哥哥你偷听了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0c43397126463567225794069f10d4954ba86a72f040cdb8cfef7f95d6716669", "ja": "いや、偶然見かけただけだ。実は、俺も真美に声を\nかけようとしてな。でも、律子に任せてよかったよ。", "zh": "没，只是偶然看见了而已。其实我刚才也正打算\n过去跟真美打声招呼呢。不过，交给律子确实挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "29d6c3170d133f1ba70e650a37f70d43154e8264f324507bcb76fdd3456d7478", "ja": "真美が緊張してたの、兄ちゃんも気づいてたの？\n律っちゃんといい、真美のことよく見てますなぁ～。", "zh": "哥哥也注意到真美在紧张吗？和律子姐一样，你们还真是很关注真美呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "de25a27c3b50e2af8e9ff3d5dc3ef1199568031f5889995cbe054aaf453ec50b", "ja": "もしかして、もしかしなくても～……、\nふたりとも真美のこと、大・大・大好きなんだね♪", "zh": "莫非，就算不是莫非也……  \n你们两个都超、超、超喜欢真美呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1009_p", "source_sha256": "89c47faa574d8b222e33a02e924eeb5567d5941337f5f4cededba5c370f36905", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。大好きだからこそ、ちょっとした\n変化にも敏感に気づけたんだ。俺も、律子もな。", "zh": "啊，当然。正因为很喜欢你，才会敏锐地察觉到你一点点的变化。我和律子都是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "77ec49b88bf7363401a429f4d7c50b9a3c5557d9cbab3cf5be6c366605b39bcd", "ja": "へっ？　そ、そっか……。\nそうなんだ……えへへ。", "zh": "诶？是、是这样啊……\n原来是这样……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bbadcafb855288513777a6d2a79f9f7376abbf69bd900b5a953c251f35179034", "ja": "ん？　どうした、真美？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，真美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "f3fad15b74ffb0142307137a0e0c70aab49b7d6da43ceb2fc73b30306ff306fc", "ja": "ううん、なんでも！　今日の成功は、律っちゃん軍曹と\n兄ちゃん司令のおかげだなってね♪", "zh": "没什么，没事！我只是在想，今天能成功，多亏了律子军曹和哥哥司令呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e23ed8b60404c07d6725d056523f654ff04999c6751f5bb3d3360ce5c5471135", "ja": "司令は言いすぎかな。\n今回俺は、そんな大層な働きはしてないからな。", "zh": "叫司令有点夸张了吧。\n这次我可没立下什么了不起的功劳啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "6c329a06ab0e97bcfbd8c039ffdf36bb15764188f248654145adc6b8434be30f", "ja": "そなの？　じゃあ真美提督から超重要ミッションを\n与えよう！　今すぐ打ち上げの準備にかかりたまえ！", "zh": "是这样吗？那就由真美提督来下达超重要任务吧！现在立刻开始准备庆功宴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "26bb3d70d45fbf9718bb0ae92ab7d80d9aa268ff3b8350e1156592e8bad5e15c", "ja": "真美の好きな物をたくさん用意するように！\nあ、律っちゃんの分も忘れずにね！", "zh": "准备好多真美喜欢的东西！\n啊，也别忘了律子的那份哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4472ba0e4e8b6196e07e63b7986cebbc2f7b40db4df71227766300f6afc66464", "ja": "それなら任せてくれ！　今日のステージにふさわしい、\n最高の打ち上げを用意するよ！", "zh": "那就交给我吧！我会准备一场最适合今天舞台的盛大庆功宴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "b8ebff8e5363254c6317284d012409d2c0377faf01d0253580ab7ff571aa7a6e", "ja": "んっふっふ～、そうこなくっちゃだよ♪\nんじゃ真美は、律っちゃんに伝えてくるね～！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～，这就对啦♪\n那真美去通知律子姐咯～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "81cd1d5e5744302e5bd35a606ab9b111999e98ca3aa087df4c0a0657c1acf2a8", "ja": "あ、兄ちゃんは、ゆっくり用意してていいよ！\nついでに話したいこと、いっぱいあるから♪", "zh": "啊，哥哥慢慢准备就好啦！\n正好我还有好多想跟你聊的事呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0354_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "5cdc3c668918f4a7e1b461aa2ca21a5f975e1d3c3a77ee5ded90dcac55937940", "ja": "言っとくけど、\n今度は盗み聞きしたらダメだかんね！", "zh": "先说好，\n这次可不许偷听哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
